<!-- Section: Requirements -->
<section class="vintage-section" style="padding-top: 1rem; padding-bottom: 4rem;">
	<div class="section-head">
		<div class="section-numeral">V. Essentials</div>
		<h2 class="section-heading">What You Need</h2>
	</div>

	<div class="essentials-grid">
		<div class="essential-card">
			<h4>Zotero 10 or Later</h4>
			<p>Running locally with local API communication enabled (<em>Settings &gt; Advanced &gt; "Allow other applications on this computer to communicate with Zotero"</em>).</p>
		</div>

		<div class="essential-card">
			<h4>An AI Model Account</h4>
			<p>Any provider supported by pi (OpenCode Go, OpenRouter, Anthropic, OpenAI, DeepSeek, or local Ollama). <a href="/models/">Tested models</a>.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="essential-card">
			<h4>A Notes Folder</h4>
			<p>Plain Markdown files (an Obsidian vault works well). Sub-Sub creates an <code>Inbox/</code> and <code>Systems/</code> directory.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
